        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <div class="options">
            <label for="map" style="font-weight:800;color:#e6fff4">Mapping call — 30 min</label>
            <div class="option small">A focused 30-minute plan to scope the right series. <strong>Free</strong> for first-time guests.</div>

            <label for="found" style="font-weight:800;color:#e6fff4">Foundations Sprint — 4 weeks</label>
